<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    2242    450    4667    71</p>
<p> Great Lakes    24265  11696   14787    31</p>
<p> River Points   13216  26622   24044    38</p>
<p> Southwest	11041   9269     646    19</p>
<p> Gulf Points    11049   8542    6711    34</p>
<p> Plains Area    30614  28759    3521    41</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10781   2300     unq    42</p>
<p> Grand Total   103208  87638   54376    35</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
